    <string name="help_guide">1) Open Connection Panel in Android app and copy ID and API Key.&#10;&#10;2) In desktop software Server URL, use https://curax-relay.onrender.com then paste ID and API Key.&#10;&#10;3) Save in desktop software and tap Connect in app.&#10;&#10;4) Alerts from desktop will come to this phone.&#10;&#10;5) Open Settings from 3 dots to set/change PIN, Auto-lock, and export chat history.&#10;&#10;6) Keep notifications enabled to receive FCM alerts when app is closed.</string>
        <string name="help_section_fcm_title">FCM Token Setup</string>
    <string name="help_section_fcm_body">- FCM token is your phone registration ID for push alerts.&#10;- Open app and tap Connect once to register or update token on relay.&#10;- Copy ID and API Key from app and paste into desktop software.&#10;- Save in desktop software to start receiving alerts on this phone.</string>
    <string name="help_section_connect_title">Connect Phone With Relay</string>
    <string name="help_section_connect_body">- Open Connection Panel in Android app.&#10;- Copy ID and API Key from app and paste into desktop software.&#10;- Save in desktop software, then alerts will start coming to this phone.</string>
    <string name="help_section_relay_title">Desktop Relay URL</string>
    <string name="help_section_relay_body">Use this fixed URL in desktop software Server URL field:&#10;https://curax-relay.onrender.com&#10;&#10;If relay URL changes in future, update it in desktop software settings.</string>
    <string name="help_section_alerts_title">Alert Delivery (FCM First)</string>
    <string name="help_section_alerts_body">- Curax sends alerts primarily using FCM push, even when app is closed.&#10;- Keep internet enabled on phone for delivery.&#10;- If phone screen is off, alert can still arrive as notification.&#10;- Tap any alert to open full details.&#10;- Swipe or multi-select checkboxes to delete, and use Undo if needed.</string>
    <string name="help_section_security_title">PIN And Fingerprint</string>
    <string name="help_section_security_body">- Open Settings -&gt; Set PIN to secure app.&#10;- Unlock screen supports PIN and fingerprint.&#10;- If fingerprint is not enrolled, phone security settings will open.</string>
    <string name="help_section_tips_title">Reliability Checklist</string>
    <string name="help_section_tips_body">- Open phone Settings and disable Battery Optimization for Curax.&#10;- Enable Auto-start/Background activity permission for Curax (on supported phones).&#10;- Keep lock-screen notifications allowed for Curax.&#10;- Allow mobile data and background data for Curax.&#10;- Turn off Data Saver for Curax (or allow unrestricted data).&#10;- Do not Force Stop the app from phone settings.&#10;- After reinstall or app data clear, open app and tap Connect again to register a new FCM token.&#10;- Keep Google Play Services enabled and updated.&#10;- Use Export chat history from Settings when needed.</string>
