    <string name="desktop_linking_code_instructions">You can create a one-time code for a user to link their desktop to you.\n\nThey enter the code in the desktop app under:\nSettings → Admin Panel → Use existing admin\n\nCode expires in 5 minutes. One-time use.\n\nTap Create code to generate a new code.</string>
